    native_build_shard_estimate_exceeds_budget_unbounded_fallback_2026-11-09, 0, "stage3 attempt 1 build_s3.log:11754 static estimate 27262976 kB, previous run 0 kB, pool commit delta 18727136 kB; owner=0/1@0 CRASH exit=-2 claimed=0 then unsharded in-process fallback peak_tree 10.6 GB killed. Fix: estimate clamped to headroom minus reserve so 1 worker always fits; no-verdict fallback retries once with 1 worker then refuses unless SIMPLE_MIR_SHARD_INPROCESS_FALLBACK=1. Not folded: interpreted_worker_fixed_2_4gb_floor / rss_blowup (parse RSS, different cause)."

